## Negative findings (why this file is `.excluded`)

**ZERO verified public benchmark numbers were found for this exact model/ID in machine/text-accessible form.** Per the self-exclusion rule this file is saved as `GLM_5.3.md.excluded` — no scored `.md` is written, and no placeholder scores are invented.

What was verified (official model card, 2026-09-15, no measured numbers):

- **Identity:** Gemini 3.8 Live — Google's near-real-time voice/multimodal interaction model, part of the Gemini 3.8 Audio family (with Live Extended Thinking, Flash TTS, Flash-Lite TTS), based on Gemini 3 Pro.
- **Specs (official model card):** inputs audio, images, video, text — 128K token context; outputs audio AND text (64K output); with Live Avatar: audio, video, text out (24K output). Live itself is the non-reasoning variant; the "Live Extended Thinking" sibling carries the reasoning configuration. Knowledge cutoff January 2025. SynthID watermarking on audio output.
- **Distribution:** Gemini API Live API, Gemini App, Google AI Studio, Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform, Google Search Live.
- **Pricing:** no per-token price verified for `gemini-3.8-live` in this research (not listed on OpenCode Zen; the Live API audio pricing page was not text-accessible).

Sources checked with no benchmark rows for this ID (2026-09-25):

- BenchLM (`gemini-3-8-live`): page exists but "Benchmark coverage is coming soon" — 0 of 483 benchmarks, unranked.
- Google DeepMind model card (`gemini-3-8-audio`): specs only, no eval numbers.
- Evals & Methodology page (`gemini-3-8-live`): published only as a binary PDF that could not be text-verified in this research.
- Gemini Audio product page: marketing descriptions only.

Scores inside this file are intentionally omitted/ignored: the sync skips `.excluded` files loudly. A future re-research should parse the official "Evals & Methodology for 3.8 Live" PDF (audio benchmarks such as speech-understanding/Real Time eval suites) or wait for BenchLM/aggregator coverage — then write a fresh `GLM_5.3.md` with real evidence.

